### Manual cases for /api/combustible (JWT + admin).
### Set @token with the accessToken returned by POST /auth/login.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE

### 1) Cities available in the naftas API  -  [Expect 200, list of names]
GET {{base}}/combustible/ciudades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2) Prices of a city (cached, refreshed after 3 days)  -  [Expect 200, desactualizado=false]
GET {{base}}/combustible/precios?ciudad=San Salvador de Jujuy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Unknown city  -  [Expect 404]
GET {{base}}/combustible/precios?ciudad=NOEXISTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Save the fuel configuration (nafta, consumo in L/100km)  -  [Expect 200]
PUT {{base}}/combustible/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ciudad": "SAN SALVADOR DE JUJUY",
  "tipo": "nafta",
  "empresa": "YPF",
  "producto": "SUPER",
  "consumo_100km": 8.5
}

### 5) GNC (consumo in m3/100km)  -  [Expect 200]
PUT {{base}}/combustible/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ciudad": "SAN SALVADOR DE JUJUY",
  "tipo": "gnc",
  "empresa": "YPF",
  "producto": "GNC",
  "consumo_100km": 9.2
}

### 6) Missing consumo  -  [Expect 400]
PUT {{base}}/combustible/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ciudad": "SAN SALVADOR DE JUJUY",
  "tipo": "nafta",
  "empresa": "YPF",
  "producto": "SUPER"
}

### 7) Product that does not exist for that type  -  [Expect 400]
PUT {{base}}/combustible/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ciudad": "SAN SALVADOR DE JUJUY",
  "tipo": "gasoil",
  "empresa": "YPF",
  "producto": "SUPER",
  "consumo_100km": 8
}

### 8) Current configuration  -  [Expect 200]
GET {{base}}/combustible/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
